                    67.0,
                    633.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "EXI decoders are able to decode the efficient EXI streams by using the same underlying XML Schema which was used for the encoding process. Schema deviations are recognized in the EXI stream. These deviations (unknown elements or attributes) can be either processed or skipped.",
            "block_bbox": [
