        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Figure 12 summarizes the Efficient XML Interchange concept for the ISO 15118 communication. Due to the high limited resource restriction the EVCC may only be able to handle the XML-based data using a corresponding data structure representation. Such data structures can be used to serialize or deSERIALize ISO 15118 communication application messages. Meanwhile, the SECC may be able to handle the data as data structure and/or the more resource intensive document object model (DOM) or in a traditional plain-text XML variant.",
